    {
        "id": "nguyen-thanh-2020",
        "artistId": "nguyen-thanh",
        "year": "2020",
        "title": "In Full Bloom",
        "slug": "2020",
        "theme": "\"IN FULL BLOOM\"",
        "description": "<p>With a rich diversity of themes and an unrelenting dedication over his 25-year artistic journey, <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong> has continuously explored, learned, and reinvented himself, creating ever-new, distinctive bodies of work that captivate viewers and lead them from one emotional state to another.<\/p><p>Through these concerns and contemplations, the artist persistently sends out messages of tranquility — stories of a green world and a vision of peace for humankind.<\/p>",
        "featuredImage": "..\/..\/images\/artists\/Nguyen Thanh\/2020\/2020_1.jpg",
        "artworkCount": 6,
        "published": true,
        "displayOrder": 1
    },
    {
        "id": "nguyen-thanh-2019",
        "artistId": "nguyen-thanh",
        "year": "2019",
        "title": "Blooming Radiance",
        "slug": "2019",
        "theme": "\"BLOOMING RADIANCE\"",
        "description": "<p>Like a clear reminder and an explicit message, <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong> addresses the world with a simple yet urgent call: \"Let us join hands to protect the Earth, to preserve a green planet for today and for generations to come.\" This statement extends and deepens the spirit of his earlier theme \"Green Planet,\" reinforcing his consistent concern for the environment and human destiny.<\/p>\n                            <p>In \"Connection\", that message becomes more resolute, almost like a prayer or a plea charged with empathy. The artist depicts lines, paths, and cords intertwined and bound together with tight knots — visual metaphors for unity and solidarity. As he explains: \"Let us stay united — all of us. Unity is strength, the enduring bond that carries us toward the shores of peace and happiness.\"<\/p>\n                            <p>Rendered in an abstract language, these works embody his decisive use of color and form, conveying both urgency and hope. Through this theme, <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong> entrusts his aspirations to the canvas — a vision of a future world that is green, harmonious, and grounded in human connection.<\/p>",
        "featuredImage": "..\/..\/images\/artists\/Nguyen Thanh\/2019\/2019_1.jpg",
        "artworkCount": 6,
        "published": true,
        "displayOrder": 2
    },
    {
        "id": "nguyen-thanh-2016",
        "artistId": "nguyen-thanh",
        "year": "2016",
        "title": "Green Planet",
        "slug": "2016",
        "theme": "\"GREEN PLANET\"",
        "description": "<p>With tireless creativity and dedication, <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong> continually explores new narratives and emotions, renewing both his brushwork and color language across diverse themes, each one a story he shares with art lovers at home and abroad.<\/p>\n                            <p>From earlier compositions that evoked a sense of peace, he moves into a strikingly different visual realm of tension and contrast, as if multiple emotional currents within him are waiting for the moment of release. Human figures appear to be flying around a great sphere, sometimes soaring upward, sometimes spiraling inward, with trees and natural forms drawn into the same orbit — suggesting a profound inner concern.<\/p>\n                            <p>As the artist reflects: \"Nature has given us precious and beautiful things; if humanity does not know how to use and preserve them, they may shatter. Let us protect our green planet — not only for today, but for tomorrow.\" The recurring image of spherical forms floating in space alludes to galaxies in constant motion, reminding viewers of a living, fragile universe that demands awareness and responsibility.<\/p>",
        "featuredImage": "..\/..\/images\/artists\/Nguyen Thanh\/2016\/z7571028455031_39e0cdf8ef03e22528c5adeadc181649.jpg",
        "artworkCount": 6,
        "published": true,
        "displayOrder": 3
    },
    {
        "id": "nguyen-thanh-2010",
        "artistId": "nguyen-thanh",
        "year": "2010",
        "title": "A Peaceful Space Above the City",
        "slug": "2010",
        "theme": "\"A PEACEFUL SPACE ABOVE THE CITY\"",
        "description": "<p>Following a period of intense emotion and powerful, decisive brushwork that led viewers into the radiant light of the cosmos, <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong>'s art reached a striking point of contrast — where vigorous, dynamic strokes met thick, textured layers of paint, rippling like waves across the surface. In this fusion of energy and stillness, the artist seems to have found the light of truth — the light of serenity, a spiritual haven where all beings yearn to dwell.<\/p>\n                            <p>Through his paintings, <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong> evokes a tranquil, poetic atmosphere, marked by deliberate spaces of emptiness — peaceful and contemplative. His palette softens into gentle hues of pale orange, warm gray, and quiet amber tones that radiate an almost meditative calm.<\/p>\n                            <p>As the artist reflects: \"The silence within is not rest, nor cessation — it is a stillness that regenerates, where inner stories are quietly in motion, transforming endlessly toward subtle prosperity.\"<\/p>\n                            <p>This theme became one of <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong>'s most distinguished artistic phases, earning him the Grand Excellence Award in Miami, Florida, USA, in December 2025. With participation from over twenty countries and more than three thousand artists worldwide, the recognition affirmed his dedication, persistence, and ever-evolving creative journey.<\/p>",
        "featuredImage": "..\/..\/images\/artists\/Nguyen Thanh\/2010\/mebeo.png",
        "artworkCount": 3,
        "published": true,
        "displayOrder": 4
    },
    {
        "id": "nguyen-thanh-2008",
        "artistId": "nguyen-thanh",
        "year": "2008",
        "title": "The Light of Heaven and Earth",
        "slug": "2008",
        "theme": "\"THE LIGHT OF HEAVEN AND EARTH\"",
        "description": "<p>Continuing his exploration of everyday life, <strong>Nguyen Thanh<\/strong> captures the interplay of light and shadow in ordinary moments.<\/p>",
        "featuredImage": "..\/..\/images\/artists\/Nguyen Thanh\/2008\/NT1.png",
