        "year": "2007",
        "title": "Memories at Seventeen",
        "slug": "2007",
        "theme": "\"MEMORIES AT SEVENTEEN\"",
        "description": "<p>Each theme in <strong>Nguyen Thanh's<\/strong> body of work unfolds as a story, and 2007 marks a deeply personal chapter exploring youth and nostalgia.<\/p>",
