        "slug": "2002",
        "theme": "\"MY HOMETOWN\"",
        "description": "<p>Those early years living and working in Ho Chi Minh City deeply influenced <strong>Nguyen Thanh's<\/strong> artistic vision, as he captured the essence of his surroundings.<\/p>",
